Aim: Display array elements using a loop.

Algorithm: Start
initialize array
traverse and print
stop.

Program:

class ArrayDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] a = {10, 20, 30, 40};
        for (int x : a) System.out.println(x);
    }
}

Result: 10, 20, 30 and 40 are displayed.
